
title: 'Registrar: Scaffolding'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      Lays out the protocol for the registrar calls that are not implemented yet. The message
      types, call signatures and response routing are in place; the bodies are stubbed with
      `TODO(ahm-v2)` and land in follow-ups.

crates:
  - name: registrar-primitives
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
  - name: pallet-registrar-relay
    bump: major
  - name: polkadot-runtime-common
    bump: minor
